# CR 305.2's default one-land-per-turn limit (maxLandPlays, land.go): the
# first playland succeeds and counts against Player.LandsPlayed; the second
# is declined by the rules and its own bool is silently discarded, the same
# convention every other declined action already has -- the Island simply
# never leaves hand.
startturn human
advance 3
playland human 1
playland human 2
